  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Sauté the onion and garlic until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the preserved lemon, capers, parsley, salt, black pepper, paprika, cumin, coriander, and crushed red pepper. Cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the scamorza cheese and stir until melted. ",
    "Sprinkle with flour and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a wooden board and serve warm.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
